=== string reserved_22
Dear friend,
If you're reading this message you've managed to get into the game's technical files. The developers congratulate you on your heroic achievement but feel they must also warn you that if you dare to change anything with your naughty little hands, the game will, in all probability, start malfunctioning or may stop running altogether.
All the best to you,
Kamikaze,
Ingame Texts Editor

